radv/ps5: an indirect draw of a mesh pipeline with no task shader runs as compute too (after lead-mesh-05..15)

lead-mesh-09 runs a lone mesh pipeline's direct draws as compute and dropped its indirect ones ("indirect mesh draw
with no task shader dropped", 8 a run in Ocarina of Time on Longshot, PS5, 2026-11-18, where the plants near the
ground were missing with the path on). The records pass already reads each draw's x, y, z at a stride from its ring;
an indirect draw's buffer is that ring, so:

- radv_mesh_compute_draw_body: the lone indirect draw's ring is the draw's indirect buffer, a draw at a time (its
  own draw ID) up to 16 draws, past that all in one records pass (draw ID 0, logged)
- radv_mesh_compute_chunk: the ring's stride and a count bias taken, the callers before it pass the task ring's
- the records pass (radv_meta_nir_build_mesh_compute_records_cs): the count buffer's draws less the bias, so a draw
  of a multi-draw with a count is drawn only when the count is past it

